BT /F3 8.10 Tf 0.14 0.23 0.32 rg 67.00 424.30 Td (function user_cost\(sol, device_params_set, nonlinear_correction\)) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.10 Tf 0.14 0.23 0.32 rg 67.00 413.40 Td (    s11 = sol.linearized.S\(\(0,\), 1, \(0,\), 1, :\)) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.10 Tf 0.14 0.23 0.32 rg 67.00 402.50 Td (    s11_db = 10 .* log10.\(abs2.\(s11\)\)) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.10 Tf 0.14 0.23 0.32 rg 67.00 391.60 Td (    objective = mean\(s11_db\) + nonlinear_correction) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.10 Tf 0.14 0.23 0.32 rg 67.00 380.70 Td (    return \(metric = objective, mean_s11_db = mean\(s11_db\)\)) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.10 Tf 0.14 0.23 0.32 rg 67.00 369.80 Td (end) Tj ET
