BT /F3 8.10 Tf 0.14 0.23 0.32 rg 67.00 602.50 Td (function user_nonlinear_correction\(sol_linear, sol_nonlinear, device_params_set\)) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.10 Tf 0.14 0.23 0.32 rg 67.00 591.60 Td (    s_lin = sol_linear.linearized.S\(\(0,\), 1, \(0,\), 1, :\)) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.10 Tf 0.14 0.23 0.32 rg 67.00 580.70 Td (    s_on  = sol_nonlinear.linearized.S\(\(0,\), 1, \(0,\), 1, :\)) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.10 Tf 0.14 0.23 0.32 rg 67.00 569.80 Td (    db\(x\) = 10 .* log10.\(abs2.\(x\)\)) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.10 Tf 0.14 0.23 0.32 rg 67.00 558.90 Td (    return mean\(db\(s_on\)\) - mean\(db\(s_lin\)\)) Tj ET
